      '## 8. Frequently Asked Questions (Multimodal AI Search & GEO)',
      '### Can AI search engines understand the text inside infographics and charts?',
      'Yes. Modern multimodal AI models possess advanced Optical Character Recognition (OCR) and visual spatial reasoning. They easily read text, parse coordinate axes, and interpret data trends from charts and diagrams without needing human transcription.',

      '### Does traditional alt text still matter in 2026?',
      'Yes. While neural vision models can see image content directly, alt text remains essential for accessibility compliance (screen readers), edge-case image load failures, and reinforcing specific semantic entity tags for search engine bots.',

      '### What image file format is best for multimodal SEO?',
